,"anchor":"Outlined-style","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"By ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", the input is with a subtle background fill and invisible bottom border, creating a softer and more contained look.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["   \/\/ An outlined text input","   OUDSPasswordInput(label: \"Your password\", password: $password, isOutlined: true)","","   \/\/ With a localizable from a bundle","   OUDSPasswordInput(LocalizedStringKey(\"password_label\"), bundle: Bundle.module, password: $password)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Rounded layout","level":3,"anchor":"Rounded-layout","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As the","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":" OUDSTextInput"},{"text":", rounded corners can be enabled or disabled using the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasRoundedTextInputs"},{"text":" values of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"text":" object","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in your theme configuration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Status","level":2,"anchor":"Status","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSPasswordInput"},{"text":" is based on the","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":" OUDSTextInput"},{"text":", all the status are the same and have the same behavior available here ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTextInput.Status"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"By default no haptics are done by the component for the trailing action.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However you should think about cases wher you will have to make the devices vibrates.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can refer to the "